{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1490415-the-book-of-everlasting-death-is-out","id":1490415,"title":"The book of everlasting death is out","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-16T11:43:39-07:00","id":1490415,"title":"The book of everlasting death is out","content":"Feel free to discuss! We also got some stuff on the shadow","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-16T20:04:04-07:00","id":1490479,"title":"","content":"So, read the book, and like it quite a bit. I like some of the old deceived stuff, so might add more of that back into my games, but it's a very useful book. The immortals and other minor guilds are right up my alley.<br /> <br /> However, I did wonder if we'll ever get any 2e Seba or Ankh relics? Or should we just make them up?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3096-lhangdon_rhyme","name":"Lhangdon_Rhyme","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-19T06:28:04-07:00","id":1490705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lhangdon_Rhyme</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1490415-the-book-of-everlasting-death-is-out?p=1490479#post1490479\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, read the book, and like it quite a bit. I like some of the old deceived stuff, so might add more of that back into my games, but it's a very useful book. The immortals and other minor guilds are right up my alley.<br /> <br /> However, I did wonder if we'll ever get any 2e Seba or Ankh relics? Or should we just make them up?</div> </div> </div> </div>My favorite relic type is Seba, and I was really looking forward to seeing them on 2e, but oh well.<br /> Thankfully there is some reference on the book of the deceived on 1e and the &quot;create your own relics&quot; on the 2e core is really good, so I don't think I'll have a lot of trouble to create my own Seba or conver the ones on 1e to 2e, though I wish there were at least one or two examples.<br /> The other relics like Ankhs and Monoliths might be a bit more challenging given the fact that there is no reference to them at 1e ou 2e, but once again, the &quot;ctreate your own relic&quot; bit from the corebook is able to handle that, just wish there was some prior reference.<br /> Really glad we got Guild affinities for minor Guilds though, a neat and necessary part that make those Guilds playable!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25516-pinkhaunt","name":"PinkHaunt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T05:45:25-07:00","id":1491748,"title":"","content":"um, where is this new publication? i cant seem to find it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26173-evtrax","name":"evtrax","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T06:30:17-07:00","id":1491752,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>evtrax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1490415-the-book-of-everlasting-death-is-out?p=1491748#post1491748\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">um, where is this new publication? i cant seem to find it</div> </div> </div> </div>It's backers PDF","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T06:54:52-07:00","id":1491756,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/